     "parent_text_authorized": false,
     "review_status": "APPROVED_AGENT_READ_ONLY_CONTEXT_V2",
     "review_note": "Check intervals are in the periodic maintenance chart, which is outside this scope and not linked. The page-91 replacement criterion is printed as \"warm to the indicator\"; that wording is unclear and is kept verbatim. The page-91 NOTE that mild disc-brake noise is normal does not establish that the pads are not worn."
